      "narrative": "Solar Foods is a public-stage biotech & health company that has raised $160M+ to date. The peer universe comprises 3 public and 8 private comparables in the same sector and stage, including Recursion Pharmaceuticals, Freenome, and Alto Neuroscience.\n\nPeer-Median valuation represents the primary applicable method. The median valuation across the 3 same-sector, same-stage public peers is $1.1B, with a range spanning $1.0B to $1.6B. Recursion Pharmaceuticals trades at $1.6B, Freenome at $1.1B, and Alto Neuroscience at $1.0B. Public-Comp Anchoring using the 6.2x P/S median for the biotech sector (based on tickers RXRX, TEM, ONT.L) cannot be applied because Solar Foods' revenue is not disclosed, which is typical for private-stage companies.\n\nThe analysis supports a valuation range of $935M (low) to $1.3B (high), with a median of $1.1B. This range reflects the peer-median benchmark and accounts for variance within the comparable set. Key uncertainties include Solar Foods' undisclosed revenue trajectory and its precise competitive positioning relative to the peer cohort. The single applicable method limits triangulation depth; additional conviction would require revenue disclosure or revenue multiples from direct peers.",
