      "narrative": "Union is a Seed-stage Defense & Security company that has raised $51.3M to date. The valuation analysis draws on a peer universe of ten companies across the sector\u2014two publicly traded and eight private\u2014including Seed and Series A stage comparables such as UFORCE, Stark Defence, Singularity, and NODA AI.\n\nTwo methods triangulate the valuation. Stage-progression analysis applies a 2.5x step-up multiplier typical of Seed-to-next-stage advancement, yielding $128M. Peer-median analysis across four same-sector and same/adjacent-stage comparables produces $700M, reflecting the broad $125M to $4.0B range observed in the Defense & Security peer set. The peer median is anchored by NODA AI at the low end ($125M), Singularity at $400M, UFORCE at $1.0B, and Stark Defence at $4.0B.\n\nThe triangulated valuation range is $109M to $805M, with a median of $414M. The substantial width between stage-progression and peer-median methods reflects two key uncertainties: the comparability of Union's technology and market position relative to later-stage funded peers, and whether peer valuations reflect market corrections or sustainable pricing in the Defense & Security sector. Stage and funding profile most directly support the lower-to-mid range; peer multiples justify consideration toward the median.",
